OL,3,GNEWSAHospital urgent care upgrade after
OL,4,Acampaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FUrgent care services in Rugby are set
OL,7,Fto be upgraded, with doctors returning
OL,8,Fto lead treatment after a years-long
OL,9,Fcampaign by local residents.
OL,11,FHospital of St Cross previously had its
OL,12,Fown A&E department, but it closed in
OL,13,F1997, and nurses currently run the
OL,14,FUrgent Treatment Centre (UTC).
OL,16,FHowever, thousands of people have
OL,17,Fsigned an open letter penned by Rugby
OL,18,FMP John Slinger, calling for changes to
OL,19,Fallow more patients to be treated
OL,20,Fcloser to home, rather than travel to
OL,21,FUniversity Hospital Coventry (UHC).
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
