OL,3,GNEWSAHospital urgent care upgrade after
OL,4,Acampaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FCoventry and Warwickshire Integrated
OL,7,FCare Board (ICB) said following a
OL,8,Fconsultation it would be introducing a
OL,9,Fnew model for urgent care in Rugby that
OL,10,Fwould see the introduction of a GP-led
OL,11,Fservice.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
